sentences.text:
The appellant shall not switch off, or change the same without prior intimation to the IO concerned,
during the period of suspension of sentence;
iii. The applicant will furnish his permanent address to the IO and in case he changes his address, he will inform the IO concerned and this Court also;
iv.

